### 1. 상품 생성
POST {{productHost}}/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
X-User-Roles: COMPANY
X-User-Email: test@google.com

{
  "companyId": "{{companyId}}",
  "name": "통합테스트 아침 한식 도시락",
  "description": "Kafka Outbox와 Elasticsearch 통합 테스트용 상품",
  "price": 89000,
  "maxOrderCount": 50,
  "category": "KOREAN",
  "mealPeriod": "BREAKFAST",
  "mealPlans": [
    {
      "dayOfWeek": "MONDAY",
      "menuName": "불고기 도시락",
      "allergyInfo": "대두, 밀",
      "nutritionInfo": "650kcal"
    },
    {
      "dayOfWeek": "WEDNESDAY",
      "menuName": "제육 도시락",
      "allergyInfo": "돼지고기, 대두",
      "nutritionInfo": "720kcal"
    },
    {
      "dayOfWeek": "FRIDAY",
      "menuName": "비빔밥",
      "allergyInfo": "계란, 대두",
      "nutritionInfo": "680kcal"
    }
  ]
}

### 2. 상품 상세 조회
GET {{productHost}}/api/v1/products/{{productId}}

### 1. product direct - keyword + 사용자 헤더 있음
GET {{productHost}}/api/v1/products?keyword=한식&page=0&size=10
X-User-Id: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
X-User-Roles: COMPANY
X-User-Email: test@google.com


### 2. product direct - keyword + 사용자 헤더 없음
GET {{productHost}}/api/v1/products?keyword=한식&page=0&size=10


### 3. gateway - keyword + 토큰 없음
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products?keyword=한식&page=0&size=10


### 4. gateway - keyword + 토큰 있음
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products?keyword=한식&page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}


### 5. gateway - category + 토큰 있음
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products?category=KOREAN&page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}


### 5. ES 검색 로그 테스트 - 배송지역 + 식사시간 검색
GET {{productHost}}/api/v1/products?region=GANGNAM&mealPeriod=BREAKFAST&page=0&size=10
X-User-Id: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
X-User-Roles: COMPANY
X-User-Email: test@google.com

### 6. ES 검색 로그 테스트 - 가격 범위 검색
GET {{productHost}}/api/v1/products?minPrice=80000&maxPrice=90000&page=0&size=10
X-User-Id: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
X-User-Roles: COMPANY
X-User-Email: test@google.com

### 7. ES 검색 로그 테스트 - 도착 시간 검색
GET {{productHost}}/api/v1/products?region=GANGNAM&arrivalStartTime=07:00&arrivalEndTime=08:30&page=0&size=10
X-User-Id: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
X-User-Roles: COMPANY
X-User-Email: test@google.com

### 8. 상품 수정 - ES products 갱신 확인용
PATCH {{productHost}}/api/v1/products/{{productId}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
X-User-Roles: COMPANY
X-User-Email: test@google.com

{
  "name": "통합테스트 프리미엄 한식 도시락",
  "description": "수정된 Elasticsearch 인덱싱 확인용 상품",
  "price": 99000,
  "maxOrderCount": 40,
  "category": "KOREAN",
  "mealPeriod": "BREAKFAST",
  "mealPlans": null
}

### 9. 수정 후 검색 확인
GET {{productHost}}/api/v1/products?keyword=프리미엄&page=0&size=10
X-User-Id: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
X-User-Roles: COMPANY
X-User-Email: test@google.com

### 주문 수량 배치 예약
POST {{productHost}}/internal/v1/products/order-quantity/reserve-bulk
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "{{orderId}}",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "{{productId}}",
      "quantity": 3
    },
    {
      "productId": "{{productId2}}",
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ]
}

### 12. 상품 삭제 - ES products 삭제 확인용
DELETE {{productHost}}/api/v1/products/{{productId}}
X-User-Id: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
X-User-Roles: COMPANY
X-User-Email: test@google.com

### 13. 삭제 후 상세 조회 실패 확인
GET {{productHost}}/api/v1/products/{{productId}}

### 14. 삭제 후 검색 제외 확인
GET {{productHost}}/api/v1/products?keyword=프리미엄&page=0&size=10
X-User-Id: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
X-User-Roles: COMPANY
X-User-Email: test@google.com

@productHost = http://localhost:19083
@productId = 여기에_실제_상품_UUID
@imagePath = ./test-image.png
@contentType = image/png

### 1. 대표 이미지 업로드 URL 발급
POST {{productHost}}/api/v1/products/images/upload-url
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uploadType": "PRODUCT_MAIN_IMAGE",
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "contentType": "{{contentType}}",
  "fileSize": 12345
}

> {%
    const body = response.body;
    const data = body.data || body.result || body;
    client.global.set("uploadUrl", data.uploadUrl);
    client.global.set("objectKey", data.objectKey);
%}

### 2. 발급받은 S3 URL로 이미지 PUT
PUT {{uploadUrl}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

< ./es배송nested.png

### 3. 업로드 완료 등록
POST {{productHost}}/api/v1/products/images/complete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uploadType": "PRODUCT_MAIN_IMAGE",
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "objectKey": "{{objectKey}}"
}

### 4. 상품 상세 조회해서 mainImageUrl 확인
GET {{productHost}}/api/v1/products/{{productId}}

@productHost = http://localhost:19083
@productId = 여기에_실제_상품_UUID
@dayOfWeek = MONDAY
@imagePath = ./test-image.png
@contentType = image/png

### 1. 요일별 식단 이미지 업로드 URL 발급
POST {{productHost}}/api/v1/products/images/upload-url
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uploadType": "MEAL_PLAN_IMAGE",
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "dayOfWeek": "{{dayOfWeek}}",
  "contentType": "{{contentType}}",
  "fileSize": 12345
}

> {%
    const body = response.body;
    const data = body.data || body.result || body;
    client.global.set("mealUploadUrl", data.uploadUrl);
    client.global.set("mealObjectKey", data.objectKey);
%}

### 2. 발급받은 S3 URL로 이미지 PUT
PUT {{mealUploadUrl}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

< ./es배송nested.png

### 3. 업로드 완료 등록
POST {{productHost}}/api/v1/products/images/complete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uploadType": "MEAL_PLAN_IMAGE",
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "dayOfWeek": "{{dayOfWeek}}",
  "objectKey": "{{mealObjectKey}}"
}

### 4. 상품 상세 조회해서 mealPlans[].imageUrl 확인
GET {{productHost}}/api/v1/products/{{productId}}
